          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We're here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, this is where we're staying.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So the two of us are
staying here together, huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, shall we go？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>O-Okay...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I'm getting nervous...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder if the hotel staff
think we're a real
married couple？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Who knows？ But with how
lovey-dovey we are, I bet
we rival the real deal.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, so you're aware of it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then why don't we
show off today, too？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'll handle check-in,
so just relax, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's fine, ● will do it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Come on, let me do it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Thanks for waiting.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Let's go, ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'll carry our bags
up to the room.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, thank you♪</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hup!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, do I look like
your wife？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲, did you say
wife……？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I signed the register
with your last name▼</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh！？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Do you mind？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>N-No.
Not at all…….</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
