          <Dialog>Eh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲, this room……？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, it's this one？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whose room is it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What do you mean, whose？
It's the room for both of us,
of course？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Together？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Do you mind？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I don't mind, but...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I mean... we came all this
way on a trip together.
Being apart？ No way.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Let's stay together the whole time？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, why do you get
so nervous every time
we go into a room？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's... well.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>When you're like that,
I don't even have time
to get nervous myself.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>My heart is pounding too,
you know. But you're so
stiff, you haven't even
noticed.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ugh, right.
Sorry.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm not blaming you.
That's part of what makes
you so cute, and I love it.</Dialog>
