          <Dialog>Oh, the buffet should be
starting around now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm so hungry.
Mmm, I might end up
eating a ton……</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Apparently they have a ton
of fresh seafood.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. If there's anything
you want, let me know and
I'll go get it for you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oka~y.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Oh man, I ate too much...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I wonder where ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲
went？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Thank you very much.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Guest A</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, no, do your best!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Were you talking to someone？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, just over there.
An older gentleman told me
a really nice story.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>An older gentleman？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You can take a boat from
Atami Port to an island
called Hatsushima.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Apparently, there's a
beach there that nobody has
ever reached.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And if two people pledge
their love there, they'll be
happy forever.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I feel like I've heard
that somewhere before……)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I kinda wanna go？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay.
Then tomorrow we'll search
for the legendary beach.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Uh-huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>By the way, who was this
older gentleman？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>He was a very dapper,
charming gentleman, you know？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hmm.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>He was... probably around
70 years old？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, are you jealous？▼</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What should we do
tomorrow？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, how about we go
back there again？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Back there... you mean
that beach？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah. That place full of
memories for us……</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, guess we can go
look for it again……</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
